Are houses available for rent in Faisal Town Islamabad? | Yes. Current portals show active houses, portions and other rental properties in Faisal Town F-18. Availability changes frequently.

What is the rent of a 5-marla house in Faisal Town? | Current 5-marla house listings commonly appear around PKR 90,000 to PKR 100,000 per month, although furnished or premium properties may be much higher. :contentReference[oaicite:5]{index=5}

What is the rent of an 8-marla house in Faisal Town? | Recent 8-marla examples range roughly around PKR 110,000 to PKR 132,000 for standard or brand-new houses, while furnished properties can be higher. :contentReference[oaicite:6]{index=6}

Are furnished houses available for rent? | Yes. Current listings include furnished 5- and 8-marla houses in Faisal Town F-18. :contentReference[oaicite:7]{index=7}

Can I rent an upper or lower portion? | Yes. Faisal Town Phase 1 currently has active upper- and lower-portion rental listings in Blocks A, B and C. :contentReference[oaicite:8]{index=8}

Which blocks have rental properties? | Current listings include rental inventory in Blocks A, B and C, although availability varies daily.

How much deposit should I pay? | Deposit terms vary by landlord and lease. Confirm the exact amount, refund conditions and payment receipt in writing before paying.

Should I inspect the house before renting? | Yes. Check utilities, parking, seepage, fixtures, meters and overall condition before signing the lease.

What should be included in the rental agreement? | Record the rent, deposit, advance payment, lease period, notice period, annual increase, repair responsibilities, utilities and handover condition.

Should I verify the landlord before paying? | Yes. Confirm that the owner or authorized representative has the legal authority to rent the property and obtain receipts for all payments.
